      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In-Memory Rate Limiter (Restricts number of allowed request per client within a specified time window)\n- User based rate limiting (fixed window algorithm)\n- Limit should be same for all users\n- Users should inform if they have exceeded the limit\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In-Memory Rate Limiter (Restricts number of allowed request per client within a specified time window)\n- User based rate limiting (fixed window algorithm)\n- Limit should be same for all users\n- Users should inform if they have exceeded the limit\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
